<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF passes on 52,000T feed wheat tender.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF passes on 52,000T feed wheat tender.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NLCF) said on Friday that it passed on a tender to buy 52,000 tonnes of corn due to higher offer prices.</p>
</text>
